        "8666": {"comment":"to the header's $10"},
        "8674": {"synopsis":"Stores the type A at $4B00; SAVE goes to SAVE_FILE; the others get a header: from tape (or\nthe ROM's network) through FIND_HEADER, from the DOS through hook 129 (HGTHD).\nEntry: A = the type.","comment":"The header's type"},
        "8677": {"comment":"CURCMD"},
        "8680": {"comment":"SAVE: SAVE_FILE"},
        "8685": {"comment":"Tape or the ROM's network?"},
        "8688": {"comment":"Yes: find the header on tape"},
        "8690": {"comment":"The DOS: the header buffer"},
