        "9128": {"comment":"Renamed as the command names it"},
        "9131": {"synopsis":"A program: sets NVARS, NUMEND and SAVARS to PROG plus the file's three offsets ($4B60),\nrestores DATA, prepares the program and handles its auto-run.","comment":"Three pointers"},
