        "9405": {"comment":"Found"},
        "9407": {"synopsis":"SAVE's end: adds LMPR to the start's page for code; then through the DOS (hook 132, HSAVE,\nIX = $4B00) or on tape or the ROM's network: the prompt (UMSGS message 3, unless TPROMPTS\nbit 1, tape only), the header block (flag 1, 80 bytes from $4B00) and the data block (flag\n$FF) from the start and length in the header.\nEntry: the header buffer at $4B00 filled.","comment":"The start"},
        "9410": {"comment":"The type"},
        "9413": {"comment":"CODE?"},
        "9415": {"comment":"No: the page as it is"},
        "9419": {"comment":"CODE: plus LMPR"},
